UID:runtime/go-1.22-eol
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250212
SUMMARY:Go 1.22 reached end of support
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Unsupported since 2025-02-11\, when the second ne
 wer Go major was released: no more security fixes.\nWho: Projects whose Go
  version (go.mod go or toolchain line\, actions/setup-go\, or a golang Doc
 ker image) is 1.22\nLast verified 2026-11-28
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/runtime/go-1.22-eol/
