BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:runtime/ubuntu-20.04-eol
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250531
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250601
SUMMARY:Ubuntu 20.04 LTS and older end standard support
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Standard security maintenance of Ubuntu 20.04 LTS
  ended in May 2025\, and of 18.04 in May 2023: the image gets no more upda
 tes without Ubuntu Pro.\nWho: Dockerfile stages and GitLab CI jobs on a Do
 cker official image whose tag names Ubuntu 20.04 (focal) or 18.04 (bionic)
  (ubuntu:20.04\, eclipse-temurin:17-jdk-focal\; tables docker-base-images 
 and container-os-releases)\nDate precision: May 2025\nLast verified 2026-1
 1-28
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/runtime/ubuntu-20.04-eol/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
