BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:github-actions/ndk-26-removal-2026
DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260113
SUMMARY:GitHub Actions: Android NDK 26 is removed from the GitHub runner im
 ages
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Android NDK 26 will be removed from all supported
  images.\nWho: Android apps that pin NDK 26.3.11579264 and are built on a 
 GitHub-hosted image without it (the removal started on 2026-01-12 and took
  about 3 days). Gradle can install it during the build when its license is
  accepted\; otherwise the build can fail.\nLast verified 2026-11-24
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/github-actions/ndk-26-removal-202
 6/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: Android NDK 26 is removed from the GitHub runne
 r images: in 30 days
TRIGGER:-P30D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:GitHub Actions: Android NDK 26 is removed from the GitHub runne
 r images: in 7 days
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
