UID:app-store/sdk-floor-2026
DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260428
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260429
SUMMARY:App Store: Uploads must be built with the 26 SDKs
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Starting April 28\, 2026\, apps and games uploade
 d to App Store Connect need to meet the following minimum requirements: iO
 S and iPadOS apps must be built with the iOS 26 & iPadOS 26 SDK or later.\
 nWho: Apps uploaded to App Store Connect (tvOS\, visionOS and watchOS apps
  need their 26 SDKs too)\nLast verified 2026-11-24
